{"headword":"שָׂרִיד","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.4\">Je 47:4</a></sup> <strong>survivor</strong> (from a defeat, etc.);—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.9\">Is 1:9</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂרִידוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 27:15\" href=\"/Job.27.15\">Jb 27:15</a> Kt; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂרִידִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:20\" href=\"/Joshua.10.20\">Jos 10:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 3:5\" href=\"/Joel.3.5\">Jo 3:5</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂרִידֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.2\">Je 31:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂרִידָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:14\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.14\">Ob 14</a> + <a data-ref=\"Job 27:15\" href=\"/Job.27.15\">Jb 27:15</a> Qr (van d. H. also Kt);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>survivor</em> (often ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּלִיט</span>): especially <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד בִּלְתִּי הִשְׁאִיר לוֹ שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:35\" href=\"/Numbers.21.35\">Nu 21:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:22\" href=\"/Joshua.8.22\">Jos 8:22</a> (both JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.3\">Dt 3:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:33\" href=\"/Joshua.10.33\">Jos 10:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:8\" href=\"/Joshua.11.8\">11:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.11\">2 K 10:11</a> (all D); more simply, <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא הִשׁ׳ שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.34\">Dt 2:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:28\" href=\"/Joshua.10.28\">Jos 10:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:30\" href=\"/Joshua.10.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:37\" href=\"/Joshua.10.37\">37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:39\" href=\"/Joshua.10.39\">39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:40\" href=\"/Joshua.10.40\">40</a> (all D); <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳ הוֹתִיר לָנוּ שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.9\">Is 1:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא יִהְיֶה שׂ׳ לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.17\">Je 42:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 44:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.44.14\">44:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:18\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.18\">Ob 18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:19\" href=\"/Job.18.19\">Jb 18:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהֶאֱבִיד שׂ׳ מֵעִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:19\" href=\"/Numbers.24.19\">Nu 24:19</a> (JE); <span dir=\"rtl\">עַם שְׂרִידֵי הָ֑רֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.2\">Je 31:2</a>, pl. also <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:20\" href=\"/Joshua.10.20\">Jos 10:20</a> (subj. of <span dir=\"rtl\">שָֽׂרְדוּ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Joel 3:5\" href=\"/Joel.3.5\">Jo 3:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:14\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.14\">Ob 14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:15\" href=\"/Job.27.15\">Jb 27:15</a> (v. supra); sg. also <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:13\" href=\"/Judges.5.13\">Ju 5:13</a> (obscure, for <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ לְ</span> read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׂרָאֵל</span> GFM Now cf. Bu), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.4\">Je 47:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:22\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.22\">La 2:22</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of things: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין שׂ׳ לְאָבְלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:21\" href=\"/Job.20.21\">Jb 20:21</a>, i.e. nothing has escaped his greed; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵ֫רַע שׂ׳ בְּאָהֳלוֹ (אֵשׁ)</span> v <a data-ref=\"Job 20:26\" href=\"/Job.20.26\">26</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB09784","strong_numbers":["8300","8301"],"next_hw":"שָׂרִיד²","prev_hw":"שָׂרַד","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","quotes":[],"GK":["8586","8587"],"TWOT":["2285a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Fr